Historically, Dogecoin lacked smart contract support and deeper programmability.

@DogeOS bridges that gap — introducing an app layer tailored for $DOGE, designed to be simple, fun, and deeply community-driven.

3/
@DogeOS is built by the team behind @MyDoge, a wallet with 500K+ users.

They’ve seen firsthand the demand for native Dogecoin apps, and are now providing the dev stack to deliver those experiences — natively and at scale. https://t.co/ZBN6PvSpel

1/
@DogeOS is positioning itself as the "operating system" of Dogecoin — a dev platform enabling consumer apps across DeFi, gaming, AI, and more, all powered by $DOGE.

It's the next logical step in transforming Dogecoin’s massive retail community into onchain users. https://t.co/J5cNTPSnbh
